      {
        "id": "falstad",
        "name": "Falstad"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Xul sinergizes very well with Heroes that are able to protect him while he receives burst damage or crowd control like Medivh. He also excels with good follow up for Bone Prison, like Tyrande with Lunar Flare, Falstad with Hinterland Blast or Li-Ming with all her Abilities."
  },
